WEBVTT

00:04.600 --> 00:05.480
Akashi!

00:06.020 --> 00:07.270
Is that you, Heito?

00:09.230 --> 00:10.280
Akashi?

00:10.780 --> 00:12.240
Heito, you say?

00:14.160 --> 00:15.820
What's wrong, Akashi?

00:15.820 --> 00:18.490
I just heard Heito's voice.

00:18.990 --> 00:20.040
What does that mean?

00:21.120 --> 00:22.540
I don't know.

00:27.420 --> 00:33.590
The world was about to be swallowed by the darkness

00:34.760 --> 00:36.470
It was then that someone made a wish—

00:36.930 --> 00:43.180
to accept the darkness and to connect with everything, bringing salvation and good news to the world.

00:46.980 --> 00:49.570
Tsugumi, let's bring an end to everything.

00:50.480 --> 00:53.320
Everything, including our sins.

00:55.200 --> 00:58.620
And then someone else made a wish.

00:59.620 --> 01:03.960
To repel the darkness no matter how we hurt each other,

01:03.960 --> 01:06.870
while filling everything with the light of supreme bliss.

01:08.840 --> 01:14.630
Both of them wished for a true dawn from the darkness of the lightless.

01:43.080 --> 01:45.370
Tsugumi, I'm here.

02:08.730 --> 02:17.070
The ink on today's graffiti runs

02:17.070 --> 02:28.080
A bicycle that has been abandoned awaits someone's return

02:28.080 --> 02:39.050
When we realized, it was up for us to choose if our existence is a replica or not

02:39.050 --> 02:43.430
Where is our proof?

02:43.430 --> 02:48.520
It's mankinds nature to come together

02:48.520 --> 02:53.560
Our love and bonds are things we can trust

02:53.560 --> 02:58.360
My sins are to be doubted

02:58.360 --> 03:04.700
The light I saw when you first held out your right hand

03:08.080 --> 03:13.540
We really are

03:22.050 --> 03:24.260
The Dark Metal

03:28.980 --> 03:33.980
Episode 22
Light, and then Light

03:29.060 --> 03:33.270
We're the only ones here now.

03:33.150 --> 03:35.060
Just like when we left Yomijima.

03:36.270 --> 03:40.780
The three of us were one when we played on the island, right?

03:41.490 --> 03:43.820
We weren't supposed to be split apart.

03:45.320 --> 03:46.410
Shut up.

03:48.290 --> 03:51.790
Since way back, all you've done is tell me to do this or that.

03:51.790 --> 03:54.960
That was always the most obnoxious thing about you.

03:56.090 --> 03:57.750
What'll Sasame do?

03:57.750 --> 03:59.300
What'll we do?

03:59.300 --> 04:00.840
You're always so full of yourself.

04:01.340 --> 04:03.090
I've had enough of it.

04:03.090 --> 04:05.050
Why is it you guys?

04:05.760 --> 04:07.890
Why can't it be Akashi?

04:20.860 --> 04:22.570
You should just die.

04:22.570 --> 04:24.070
You, Sasame, and everyone.

04:24.410 --> 04:25.820
All of you!

04:25.820 --> 04:27.530
Everyone!

04:32.540 --> 04:35.290
Tsugumi, you're acting weird.

04:35.830 --> 04:38.670
There's something strange about your heart.

04:39.920 --> 04:41.880
You resent us.

04:41.880 --> 04:44.130
And you think we deserve to die?

04:44.130 --> 04:45.380
Is that really the case?

04:45.380 --> 04:46.640
It is!

05:02.190 --> 05:04.150
You can kill me all you want.

05:04.150 --> 05:06.410
I won't run away.

05:07.160 --> 05:10.160
Now, kill me, Tsugumi.

05:10.950 --> 05:12.120
Fine.

05:14.750 --> 05:18.670
You will die now, you traitor.

05:26.720 --> 05:28.970
You couldn't kill me after all.

05:33.680 --> 05:34.810
Why?

05:35.850 --> 05:39.230
Because that's not what your true feelings are.

05:42.570 --> 05:43.820
What are you talking about?

05:45.280 --> 05:46.530
Stay away from me!

05:52.240 --> 05:54.040
I'm telling you to stay away!

05:55.160 --> 05:56.290
Show me.

05:57.580 --> 05:58.710
It's fine, right?

05:58.710 --> 05:59.750
No way.

05:59.750 --> 06:01.630
It's just you.

06:01.630 --> 06:03.130
Show me!

06:04.760 --> 06:05.510
No!

06:05.510 --> 06:07.430
Stop it, Minashi!

06:09.840 --> 06:12.560
I want to save you, Tsugumi.

06:14.850 --> 06:15.810
Minashi...

06:24.480 --> 06:26.400
Stop it.

06:37.040 --> 06:40.750
Weird, the Lightless Realm's advance has stopped.

06:41.170 --> 06:43.210
Could Minashi possibly have...

06:43.210 --> 06:46.590
I don't know the reason, but it seems to have calmed down.

06:47.550 --> 06:49.840
What in the world is going on?

06:53.260 --> 06:54.760
Why?

06:56.890 --> 06:57.810
Is it you?

06:57.810 --> 06:59.020
Why'd you do this?

06:59.520 --> 07:00.390
It's terrible!

07:00.390 --> 07:02.150
Turn us back to normal!

07:02.980 --> 07:04.480
I'm not the villain!

07:04.480 --> 07:06.150
It's not my fault!

07:06.150 --> 07:09.320
I just did as I was told!

07:09.740 --> 07:13.410
Besides, I didn't make this by myself!

07:13.410 --> 07:16.290
The kids who made this with me all ran away!

07:17.370 --> 07:18.200
Tsugumi...

07:18.750 --> 07:22.960
Come back, Sasame, Minashi!

07:22.960 --> 07:25.040
The people who died are angry...

07:25.540 --> 07:27.670
So many are angry and bitter...

07:27.670 --> 07:33.550
The deity's power from within the Lightless Stone is flaring up, but they're saying it's my fault.

07:33.550 --> 07:36.260
I want the three of us to go back to the island.

07:37.680 --> 07:41.100
I want to go back to the island.

07:41.600 --> 07:43.310
This is a scary place.

07:44.060 --> 07:46.110
We're all apart...

07:46.110 --> 07:48.860
Getting angry, hating others, and being sad...

07:49.650 --> 07:50.860
I'm scared.

07:50.860 --> 07:51.990
I hate it.

07:53.700 --> 07:58.290
For ten years, you cowered like this all by yourself.

07:59.540 --> 08:00.500
Let's go back.

08:01.290 --> 08:03.330
We can be one again like we were back then.

08:04.170 --> 08:06.250
I'm sure Akashi will understand too.

08:08.000 --> 08:09.000
Akashi...

08:10.090 --> 08:15.140
If everybody can become one,
nobody will pass by each other again.

08:16.220 --> 08:18.600
We can all be happy.

08:18.600 --> 08:20.600
Even you and Akashi.

08:20.600 --> 08:21.560
Really?

08:21.560 --> 08:22.480
Yup.

08:31.740 --> 08:33.780
You don't get it, Minashi.

08:34.320 --> 08:37.870
Even if everyone became connected, they won't all become happy.

08:39.580 --> 08:44.790
You're saying I should connect with all these people who're constantly blaming me?

08:45.330 --> 08:50.960
Even when the darkness in their hearts gave the Lightless Stone power?

08:50.960 --> 08:54.300
They're the ones who're corrupt, and yet they blame me!

08:54.300 --> 08:57.510
I refuse to connect with people like them!

08:57.510 --> 08:59.470
Wait, Tsugumi!

08:59.470 --> 09:03.520
The islanders didn't wish for
the Lightless Realm to expand!

09:04.020 --> 09:05.270
Like I give a shit!

09:05.270 --> 09:06.770
They're all sinners.

09:06.770 --> 09:09.480
They can all suffer without exception!

09:10.070 --> 09:14.320
They deserve to suffer much, much more than I do!

09:14.320 --> 09:15.360
I hate this!

09:15.360 --> 09:17.200
I can't take this anymore...

09:17.660 --> 09:19.910
Everyone should just die!

09:32.340 --> 09:35.220
The Lightless Realm's expansion restarted?

09:35.220 --> 09:36.220
What?

09:36.630 --> 09:38.970
And it's accelerating rapidly!

09:38.970 --> 09:41.720
We have about three minutes until it reaches us!

09:42.140 --> 09:44.140
Everyone, retreat!

09:44.140 --> 09:45.640
We'll be engulfed in the Lightless Realm!

09:57.200 --> 09:59.030
You with us, Mahmu?

09:59.030 --> 10:00.200
Yes!

10:00.200 --> 10:01.620
Obstacle ahead!

10:07.080 --> 10:07.870
Mahmu!

10:10.290 --> 10:11.290
Akashi!

10:11.290 --> 10:13.920
Look after Kasane-san's group!

10:13.920 --> 10:14.670
Got it!

10:15.210 --> 10:15.970
Mahmu!

10:15.970 --> 10:17.050
Are you all right?

10:17.050 --> 10:19.590
Y-Yes, sorry...

10:22.640 --> 10:25.470
You'll be fine if you keep resonating with Emiru.

10:25.470 --> 10:26.810
Let's catch up quickly.

10:28.310 --> 10:29.190
Right!

10:48.540 --> 10:49.330
Over here!

10:49.330 --> 10:50.330
Hurry!

10:52.040 --> 10:54.300
Coming into contact with the Lightless Realm!

11:10.560 --> 11:11.770
What is this?

11:17.440 --> 11:20.450
The psyche encroachment is strong.

11:20.450 --> 11:21.820
Are you all right, Iwato?

11:21.820 --> 11:22.530
Raika?

11:28.950 --> 11:29.870
Dammit.

11:30.290 --> 11:36.340
Without Big Brother and the resonance, I can't even snap out of this illusion?

11:39.090 --> 11:40.670
What should I do, Emiru?

11:41.130 --> 11:44.300
Everyone's caught in the Lightless Realm, and I'm the only one left.

11:47.720 --> 11:48.520
That's...

12:03.910 --> 12:07.080
Can't anyone hear my voice?

12:07.080 --> 12:07.700
Iwato!

12:07.990 --> 12:08.950
Raika!

12:08.950 --> 12:09.950
Mahmu!

12:12.040 --> 12:12.960
Dammit!

12:13.710 --> 12:15.580
Shut up.

12:17.380 --> 12:22.090
Don't come in as you please
and get in the way of my solitude.

12:22.550 --> 12:23.340
What?

12:27.890 --> 12:28.890
I'm back?

12:29.770 --> 12:33.270
Please, someone, take notice!

12:33.270 --> 12:34.350
Mahmu?

12:34.350 --> 12:35.940
Oh, Akashi-kun!

12:54.920 --> 12:56.540
Have we been spared?

12:56.540 --> 12:57.630
Yes.

12:58.750 --> 13:01.710
Isn't this an Arbornine?

13:01.710 --> 13:03.220
Since when was this here?

13:03.220 --> 13:04.300
This...

13:04.300 --> 13:06.840
It was originally a different tree.

13:11.140 --> 13:12.180
It's so pretty.

13:14.690 --> 13:18.400
I want to be... just like this...

13:20.610 --> 13:23.530
What am I capable of doing?

13:30.200 --> 13:37.000
The expansion rate has stabilized, but it hasn't stopped.

13:37.000 --> 13:41.840
People outside of Japan have been
debating ways to deal with the Lightless Realm.

13:42.550 --> 13:46.180
We have a very limited amount of time left.

13:47.300 --> 13:50.260
Who knows how long the Arbornine will last.

13:50.760 --> 13:53.640
But to think it would be here of all places.

13:53.930 --> 13:57.390
No, it's not that an Arbornine was here.

13:57.390 --> 13:59.400
It's that it turned into an Arbornine.

14:00.690 --> 14:08.780
Arbornine was the form of a normal plant that evolved itself to continue living within the Lightless Realm.

14:09.360 --> 14:13.410
Two trees connecting to fight the Necrometal infection.

14:13.830 --> 14:16.160
The same method as LIMs.

14:16.160 --> 14:21.960
If we can shed light on this adaptation,
we could prevent the Necrometal shifts.

14:21.960 --> 14:23.210
We did it.

14:23.210 --> 14:25.170
It's all thanks to Mahmu.

14:26.260 --> 14:27.970
B-But I...

14:28.680 --> 14:31.930
I absolutely want to save Emiru and Sasame too.

14:34.720 --> 14:38.060
This battle will be entirely in the Lightless Realm.

14:38.770 --> 14:43.110
You'll all carry Arbornine fruit, but its effects are unknown.

14:43.110 --> 14:44.320
Don't let your guard down.

14:44.690 --> 14:46.740
And what's the plan?

14:46.740 --> 14:50.820
First, we need to get the Corpse away from the central area.

14:50.820 --> 14:53.450
So use the same bait trick we did last time?

14:54.200 --> 14:55.660
Exactly.

14:55.660 --> 14:58.580
Akashi, I'm going to ask you to be the bait.

15:01.380 --> 15:09.090
Past data shows high chances of him being safe with
the Arbornine fruit even in the Lightless Realm's center.

15:09.590 --> 15:13.100
We need to research his resonance with Heito more,

15:13.680 --> 15:18.430
but perhaps Akashi has a resonance ability that is yet unknown.

15:18.980 --> 15:22.980
And he's fought the Corpse more than anyone else here.

15:23.520 --> 15:28.400
After luring it, he'll switch to the Argent, and all units will strike.

15:28.940 --> 15:34.280
It's not 100% sure, but it's the plan with the highest chance.

15:34.280 --> 15:35.410
You can do this, right?

15:35.830 --> 15:37.160
Of course.

15:37.160 --> 15:38.540
Excuse me!

15:39.160 --> 15:42.210
Could I go instead?

15:42.210 --> 15:43.040
Mahmu?

15:43.040 --> 15:44.250
Why now?

15:44.960 --> 15:48.670
Going in a MA-Vess is probably soundest, right?

15:49.210 --> 15:50.880
Yes, but...

15:50.880 --> 15:56.470
Raika-san, you said before that you were
fighting so you wouldn't regret anything, right?

15:58.020 --> 16:03.100
I agree with that, and I can tell Emiru feels the same way too.

16:04.270 --> 16:05.650
Don't overdo it.

16:06.360 --> 16:07.270
Okay.

16:07.270 --> 16:10.400
But I think I'll be fine with just running away.

16:11.070 --> 16:12.610
I'm fast at that.

16:14.360 --> 16:15.280
All right.

16:15.910 --> 16:19.040
I'll change the plan to center around Mahmu then.

16:32.550 --> 16:33.970
Thank you.

16:33.970 --> 16:36.720
I didn't think you would volunteer to do this.

16:37.220 --> 16:38.470
Neither did I.

16:39.680 --> 16:44.100
I used to be satisfied with nothing but writing stories.

16:44.480 --> 16:47.270
It's strange I could say things like that.

16:47.270 --> 16:51.240
Maybe there's some of Emiru in me?

16:51.940 --> 16:55.110
No, those were truly your own words.

16:55.610 --> 16:57.280
Believe in yourself.

16:57.280 --> 16:58.620
Okay.

16:58.620 --> 17:00.450
Sortie preparations complete.

17:01.450 --> 17:02.540
All units, move out!

17:03.000 --> 17:06.040
All vesses, cover the Sable till the entry point!

17:07.790 --> 17:09.840
Mahmu, don't lag behind.

17:09.840 --> 17:10.380
Okay!

17:10.800 --> 17:12.260
They're over there!

17:19.930 --> 17:24.390
Die, die, die, die, die!

17:24.730 --> 17:25.850
Tsugumi?

17:26.810 --> 17:28.520
Thirty seconds to entry point!

17:33.570 --> 17:34.570
Go, Sable!

17:38.120 --> 17:39.830
It'll all end with this!

17:40.490 --> 17:42.660
It's up to you, Mahmu, Emiru!

17:42.660 --> 17:43.200
Right!

17:49.170 --> 17:52.500
The story of the lightless will end with this.

17:53.670 --> 17:57.090
I'll make sure it ends with our power.

17:58.510 --> 18:02.100
From here, our own story is going to start.

18:03.060 --> 18:06.600
No matter how small, I believe that there is some light.

18:07.770 --> 18:08.940
Let's go, Emiru!

18:14.820 --> 18:16.740
Do your best, Mahmu.

18:19.610 --> 18:20.740
It's the Corpse...

18:36.670 --> 18:37.630
There it is!

18:41.140 --> 18:42.430
What's this?

18:42.430 --> 18:43.390
It's huge.

18:44.310 --> 18:45.560
This is impossible.

18:50.310 --> 18:52.560
But I have to do this!

18:58.860 --> 18:59.700
It's coming!

19:06.370 --> 19:08.370
Sable has contact with the Corpse!

19:09.120 --> 19:11.420
If I could pilot a MA-Vess...

19:11.420 --> 19:12.710
Akashi!

19:13.250 --> 19:14.590
Again?

19:14.590 --> 19:15.670
What do you want?

19:16.460 --> 19:17.670
Akashi...

19:23.010 --> 19:24.970
Resonance with Akashi?

19:25.430 --> 19:26.890
You're the one calling me.

19:27.640 --> 19:30.140
Do you want a LIM or something?

19:30.690 --> 19:32.440
It's none of your business!

19:32.940 --> 19:35.020
Want me to be one with you?

19:35.020 --> 19:36.230
What?

19:36.230 --> 19:38.690
I'll force myself to resonate with you.

19:39.440 --> 19:41.490
Just like I did with Emiru.

19:42.780 --> 19:48.870
Even in Natsuiri's data, it was
acknowledged that Heito had high resonance.

19:50.410 --> 19:51.330
Can it be?

19:56.290 --> 19:58.260
How long will you do this, Mahmu?

19:58.760 --> 20:01.090
At this rate, the Corpse will go back.

20:01.090 --> 20:02.630
No, I have to go!

20:03.510 --> 20:09.560
Just as the Arbornine changed its shape to protect the creatures gathered around it,

20:09.560 --> 20:12.480
I should also be able to change.

20:13.440 --> 20:14.730
No.

20:14.730 --> 20:15.610
I <i>will</i> change!

20:24.740 --> 20:26.120
You won't catch up!

20:29.290 --> 20:30.450
Follow me!

20:51.480 --> 20:53.520
I-I can't move!

20:53.520 --> 20:55.600
No, you have to move!

20:57.310 --> 21:01.780
Move! Move! Move! Move! Move!

21:04.530 --> 21:07.990
An end like this absolutely won't do!

21:07.990 --> 21:10.700
I'm going to take the Corpse to everyone!

21:12.540 --> 21:14.000
Move for me!

21:21.380 --> 21:22.300
Emiru...

21:23.630 --> 21:28.800
If there was at least one person who would take the time to look at her,

21:29.890 --> 21:32.270
then perhaps the world would seem better.

21:35.140 --> 21:36.100
Yeah.

21:36.100 --> 21:37.940
Thank you, Emiru.

21:49.120 --> 21:51.160
The story about Emiru and me.

21:51.990 --> 21:54.870
I'll make sure it comes to a happy ending!

22:05.050 --> 22:08.840
I have to hurry and take it over to the others.

22:28.610 --> 22:29.490
Are you all right, Mahmu?

22:31.030 --> 22:32.410
Akashi-kun...

22:56.390 --> 23:00.440
You lose your mind, you crash; a nervous breakdown

23:00.440 --> 23:05.190
You feel an urge inside, you crush; there's no escape now

23:05.190 --> 23:10.070
You try to change your life, you jump another let down

23:10.070 --> 23:12.660
But then you hear a voice inside

23:12.660 --> 23:15.950
You gotta open up your vision and see the life bestowed on you

23:15.950 --> 23:18.540
Blinded by reality

23:18.540 --> 23:20.710
Broken ideology

23:20.710 --> 23:23.250
Heart in captivity

23:23.250 --> 23:25.590
Hold on, exceeding the borders within

23:25.590 --> 23:28.090
Seize your capability

23:28.090 --> 23:30.470
Endless possibility

23:30.470 --> 23:32.800
Find your individuality

23:32.890 --> 23:35.010
Take pride; let the chase begin

23:35.010 --> 23:37.680
Don't tell me what direction you think I should take

23:37.680 --> 23:39.480
I know now to find the way

23:39.480 --> 23:42.480
Don’t tell me that this sable is for my own sake

23:42.480 --> 23:44.020
Here's what I’ve got to say

23:44.020 --> 23:47.280
Don't tell me to believe the decisions you make

23:47.280 --> 23:49.490
Facing a new day

23:49.490 --> 23:51.490
So open up your blinded eyes

23:51.490 --> 23:54.490
Stop living a lie and start living your life

23:54.490 --> 23:56.830
My way or no way

23:56.830 --> 23:59.290
Today you’re falling away

24:04.960 --> 24:09.960
Episode 23

24:04.960 --> 24:09.960
Proof of the Strongest
